{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few months before I published this game, my infant daughter began discovering computers. She loved pushing the buttons on the keyboard and biting the mouse. My wife remarked that it would be nice if there was a program that would simply do things when she pushed the buttons, so that it was a more engaging activity. That idea grew into Pretty buttons, a visual sensory experience ideal for any sensory seeking individuals, not just children. See all 50 different effects in the default mode, or make each button push select a random effect in random mode. Or, sit back and watch the show with auto mode. Enjoy this casual interactive experience I made for my daughter, and now share with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is in a beta state, with content updates planned in the future. The coming soon button on the homepage will be replaced with a learning mode that will help teach the buttons on the keyboard and their names.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724550?t=1747847891","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724550?t=1747847891","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724550/e72ed1046f05c6e86fce8b7688da8a821d540493/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747847891","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724550/e72ed1046f05c6e86fce8b7688da8a821d540493/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747847891","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few months before I published this game, my infant daughter began discovering computers. She loved pushing the buttons on the keyboard and biting the mouse. My wife remarked that it would be nice if there was a program that would simply do things when she pushed the buttons, so that it was a more engaging activity. That idea grew into Pretty buttons, a visual sensory experience ideal for any sensory seeking individuals, not just children. See all 50 different effects in the default mode, or make each button push select a random effect in random mode. Or, sit back and watch the show with auto mode. Enjoy this casual interactive experience I made for my daughter, and now share with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is in a beta state, with content updates planned in the future. The coming soon button on the homepage will be replaced with a learning mode that will help teach the buttons on the keyboard and their names.</p>","developers":["Valkyrja Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724550/12fd585af29584215f2182d5c457ea31e1a80d5d/header.jpg?t=1747847891","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any up to date version<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 950 or Radeon HD 7970<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3724550/884775/3d033ad4d26f7966364bc0705acefaf145cb58e0/1750393641/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746671568","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3724550/884775/3d033ad4d26f7966364bc0705acefaf145cb58e0/1750393641/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746671568","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3